# explainer-video (M11): the explainer at real speed, recorded: the pointer onto a's chip, the
# explainer coming out of its caret 400 ms later, then the pointer onto the top bar and the
# explainer going back. WebKit's recordings time it (plan call 15).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
video start explainer
wait 300
move 70 424
wait 1400
move 760 48
wait 700
video stop
